### PRODUCTION API TESTS (Vercel Deployment)
@baseUrl = https://aqabackend-9llxvgslt-adithyavennas-projects.vercel.app

### LOCAL API TESTS
@localUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ==== PRODUCTION TESTS ====

### 1. Health Check (Production)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### 2. Signup - New User (Production)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Farmer John",
  "farmName": "Sunny Creek Farm",
  "email": "farmer@aqashrimp.ai",
  "phone": "+15550192",
  "preferredLanguage": "English",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 3. Login (Production)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "farmer@aqashrimp.ai",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Get User Profile (Production - Replace TOKEN with actual JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 5. Update User Profile (Production - Replace TOKEN with actual JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "fullName": "Updated Farmer John",
  "farmName": "Updated Farm Name",
  "phone": "+919999999999",
  "preferredLanguage": "Telugu"
}

###

